<title>USA: LoJack Corp ups buyback to 3.2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>LoJack Corp ups buyback to 3.2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DEDHAM, Mass. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>LoJack Corp said Monday that its board has raised the number of common shares it may repurchase to 3.2 million shares from 2.2 million shares.</p>
<p>The company said it had bought 1,622,000 shares as of January 3.</p>
<p>&quot;At current price levels, we believe this program represents an attractive investment opportunity for the company,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
<p>LoJack closed Friday at 10.</p>
